{"id":103448,"imdb":"tt0233234","en":"Land of Fear","orig":"أرض الخوف","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"يحيى ضابط في الشرطة وهو شخص مثالي لأعلى الدرجات. يوكل من قبل جهاز الشرطة بأن يصبح فاسدًا في العالم السفلي (عالم تجارة المخدارت) وذلك كما قيل له لخدمة الوطن، فيكلف بمهمة غريبة تسمى أرض الخوف، يعيش يحيي لسنوات كتاجر مخدرات، ولكنه بعد ذلك يكتشف الكارثة حيث أن الضباط الذين وضعوا يحيى في هذه المهمة، منهم من استقال ومنهم من مات ليصبح يحيى بالفعل تاجر مخدرات ولكن بقلب ضابط.","rd":"2000-03-15","rt":134,"g":[18,80],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":200,"companies":[{"n":"Arab Society for Advertising & Cultural Production","logo":null,"c":""}],"countries":["EG"],"langs":["Arabic"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"EG","d":"2000-03-15"},{"c":"TN","d":"2000-09-22"},{"c":"JP","d":"2007-03-14"}],"dir":["Daoud Abdel Sayed"],"prod":["Amal Abu Shadi"],"wri":["Daoud Abdel Sayed"],"mus":["Rageh Daoud"],"dop":["Samir Bahzan"],"cast":[{"n":"Ahmed Zaki","ch":"Yehia / Adam","p":"/nEJQTsgWDh1aXQLFsWkXOAv7hD4.jpg"},{"n":"Farah","ch":"Farida","p":"/uaCu8eSn8WDN3Dreo3jH9bkw8ap.jpg"},{"n":"Samy El Adl","ch":"Saady el manzlawy","p":"/3a866qPfEYhTa4ragVkg1lYnA5e.jpg"},{"n":"Hamdy Ghaith","ch":"Hodhod","p":"/2ncZ7niUc54L0DWKqdb0EZkLpGh.jpg"},{"n":"Ezzat Abu Ouf","ch":"Omar Elassiouty","p":"/b4YIsca9urhYbAUWf1ftW440gcd.jpg"},{"n":"Ahmed Kamal","ch":"Ragab abo hussien","p":"/jbcXAcGeSNCGwZ4xwoUf2d0Lp1X.jpg"},{"n":"Abdul Rahman Abu Zahra","ch":"Mousa","p":"/8IZuTHmfKwnPTxOGPoegE4mCW8r.jpg"},{"n":"Zeina","ch":"Hanaa","p":"/rzViYmGwblIdvKbIqhr1t56MSO9.jpg"},{"n":"Safaa Al Toukhy","ch":"","p":"/yxOX751sJBUB5UdkSomgXT86hK5.jpg"},{"n":"Fathy Abdel Wahab","ch":"","p":"/kYIlzvwURNRxrQED5OtkqYCUN8Z.jpg"},{"n":"Thuraya Ibrahim","ch":"","p":"/7249NH6S9y7DkervQBNeA4aSELR.jpg"},{"n":"Mokhles ElBehiry","ch":"","p":"/sj6TIyVTggZfiO1PO9rOMGQp0In.jpg"},{"n":"Yousri ElAshmawy","ch":"","p":"/wjkQhusQkonPiH9VNZ8fnyv3kG0.jpg"},{"n":"Saffwa","ch":"","p":"/o9q6PJmND52brl9yk0kxDshfJtl.jpg"},{"n":"Mohamed Gibreel","ch":"","p":"/7PVVT9FGs